      "India’s first RO with breakthrough patented Auto Mineral Guard™ technology. It lets you choose the mineral content and taste of your water with just a simple tap on your phone.",
      "India's First Smart Water Purifier: Equipped with features like Device Health Check that helps user monitor the purifier’s health with a 21-point scan at the touch of a button on the app., Water Quality Indicator provides real-time updates on the input and output TDS, Hydration Monitor helps track your daily, weekly, and monthly water consumption, and Filter Life Monitoring system alerts you when it's time to replace the filters. But that's not all, it also detects when your filters are nearing expiry or if there is any problem in the purifier and automatically sends service booking request on the app, without the user worrying about the hassle of calling a technician.",
